auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

vars:pre-request {
}

docs {
  # agent-1o1-ai API

  Internal V1 API (bearer/Passport auth) plus the Public V1 API (API-key auth).

  ## Auth flow

  1. Run `auth/Register` or `auth/Login`. Their post-response script stores
     `accessToken` and `refreshToken` as collection variables.
  2. Every other Internal V1 request inherits collection-level bearer auth
     and automatically uses `{{accessToken}}`.
  3. Requests under `workspaces/{workspace}/...` also need a `workspaceId`
     variable set (see the `local` environment) — set it after creating or
     listing a workspace.
  4. Public V1 requests (`public/...`) use a workspace API key instead —
     set `{{apiKey}}` from `workspaces/api-keys/Create Api Key`.
}
